{pad:meta title='The condition on the closing tag', about='Tested after each pass: the content renders once even though the condition is false from the start.'/}
{pad:set $tries = 7/}
<p>Before: {pad:while $tries lt 3}[{$tries}]{pad:increment $tries/}{/pad:while} - nothing.</p>
<p>After: {pad:while}[{$tries}]{pad:increment $tries/}{/pad:while $tries lt 3} - one pass.</p>
